---
import AppDocLayout from '../../layouts/AppDocLayout.astro';
---

<AppDocLayout
  title="Ebb - Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for Ebb - Breathing Exercises, the iOS app. No data collected; your sessions stay on your iPhone and Apple Watch."
  ogUrl="https://idlefusion.com/ebb/privacy"
>
  <main>
    <section class="section-padding">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)] mb-12">Ebb - Breathing Exercises &middot; Effective October 25, 2026</p>

        <div class="space-y-8 text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">The Short Version</h2>
            <p>Ebb does not collect, store, or transmit any personal data. There&rsquo;s no account, no analytics, no ads and no tracking. Your sessions never leave your devices unless you choose to share them.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Data Storage</h2>
            <p>Each session you finish (the pattern, when it started, how long you breathed, and how you felt if you answer that question) and your settings, such as your theme, length and nudge time, are stored locally on your iPhone. They are shared with Ebb&rsquo;s own widgets through an App Group on the same device, and with your paired Apple Watch, so you can breathe from either. No data is sent to any server, cloud service, or third party. There are no user accounts and no sign-up required.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Apple Health</h2>
            <p>Apple Health is off unless you turn it on. If you turn on Save mindful minutes, Ebb writes the time you spent breathing to Apple Health as mindful minutes. Ebb only writes: it never reads any Health data. You can turn this off at any time in Ebb&rsquo;s settings or in the Health app.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Import and Export</h2>
            <p>Importing from Breathe Easy reads only Breathe Easy&rsquo;s history on your device. Exports (a CSV of your sessions) are created on your device and go only where you send them with the share sheet.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Notifications</h2>
            <p>The daily nudge is a local notification scheduled on your device. It is not sent through any server, and nothing is sent to us.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Analytics & Tracking</h2>
            <p>Ebb contains no analytics frameworks, no ad SDKs, no tracking pixels, and no telemetry of any kind. We do not use any third-party services that collect data.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Network Usage</h2>
            <p>Ebb makes no network requests. The app works entirely offline. The only network activity associated with the app is through the App Store, for updates and for optional tips. Tips are handled entirely by Apple; Ebb never sees your payment details or Apple Account.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Your Choices</h2>
            <p>You can export every session as a CSV, delete a single session from the Log, or delete everything from Settings &rarr; Your data. Deleting the app removes all of its data from your device.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Children's Privacy</h2>
            <p>Ebb does not knowingly collect any information from anyone, including children under the age of 13.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Changes to This Policy</h2>
            <p>If this policy changes, we will update this page with the new effective date. Since Ebb collects no data, meaningful changes are unlikely. Questions? Email <a href="mailto:support@idlefusion.com" class="text-[var(--accent-primary)] hover:underline">support@idlefusion.com</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</AppDocLayout>
